      "otherdesignations": "breast cancer type 2 susceptibility protein|BRCA1/BRCA2-containing complex, subunit 2|BRCA2 DNA repair associated protein|DNA repair-associated BRCA2|Fanconi anemia group D1 protein|breast and ovarian cancer susceptibility gene, early onset|breast and ovarian cancer susceptibility protein 2|breast cancer 2 tumor suppressor|breast cancer 2, early onset|mutant BRCA2|mutant DNA repair-associated protein 2",
